            <div xml:id="d867-a2">

                <pb facs="0838" n="740" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg740"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Count Mutsu to Dr. Kinyoun.</hi></head>
                <p>Health board informs me Surgeon-General Marine Hospital issued order prohibiting
                    Japanese from leaving city without inoculation against plague. Kindly inform me
                    if such is the case, and if so, why order was issued.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mutsu</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Consul of Japan.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
